{"ID":"20240205153757-n5wu7wa","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153757-n5wu7wa","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153757-n5wu7wa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094539-en2o110\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619182647-jk0gusj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1239,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619182647-jk0gusj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"草果（草果仁）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902164908"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206094539-en2o110","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094539-en2o110","updated":"20240206094547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于贵州、广西、云南等地。\n【性状】\t果实椭圆形，长24.5cm，直径12.5cm，表面棕色或红棕色，具3钝棱及明显的纵沟及棱线，先端有圆形突起的柱基，基部有果柄或果柄痕，果皮坚韧，内分3室，每室含种子724粒，种子集结成团。种子多面形，直径57mm，黄棕色或红棕色，具灰白色膜质假种皮，中央有凹陷合点，较狭端腹面有圆窝状种脐，种脊凹陷成1纵沟。气芳香，味辛、辣。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t燥湿除寒，祛痰截疟，消食化食。主治疟疾，痰饮痞满，脘腹冷痛，反胃，呕吐，泻痢，食积。\n【炙品】\t姜草果仁：取草果仁，加姜汁与水少许，拌匀，微炒，取出，放凉 (每草果仁100斤，用鲜姜10斤取汁) 。增强止呕功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240206094540-k3uyqgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094540-k3uyqgp","updated":"20240206094540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206094540-ha2sh52.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205161113-enkoc2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205161113-enkoc2w","updated":"20240205161113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果-20240205161113-00z2r49.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724141631-nab7hni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724141631-nab7hni","updated":"20240724141631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 407px;","style":"width: 397px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 6-20240724141631-dfsmasj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 397px;\" parent-style=\"width: 407px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724133915-ujl4rl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724133915-ujl4rl3","updated":"20240724141845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 7-20240724141845-wieokb5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 576px;","style":"width: 566px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果-20240724133915-ccsxwwg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 566px;\" parent-style=\"width: 576px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724135259-jj48a15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724135259-jj48a15","updated":"20240724141608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 621px;","style":"width: 611px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 5-20240724141608-2e5kf9y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 611px;\" parent-style=\"width: 621px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 622px;","style":"width: 612px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 3-20240724141339-a2chkb6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 612px;\" parent-style=\"width: 622px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724142355-3p47vvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724142355-3p47vvk","updated":"20240724142425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 716px;","style":"width: 706px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 10-20240724142355-w9yel4k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 706px;\" parent-style=\"width: 716px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 529px;","style":"width: 519px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 11-20240724142425-lzf1h81.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 519px;\" parent-style=\"width: 529px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724142506-n6p47yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724142506-n6p47yj","updated":"20240724143008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 601px;","style":"width: 591px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 13-20240724142949-l4043nl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 591px;\" parent-style=\"width: 601px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 675px;","style":"width: 665px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 12-20240724142506-sctu87h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 665px;\" parent-style=\"width: 675px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724141218-ths7mmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724141218-ths7mmm","updated":"20240724141221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 526px;","style":"width: 516px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 2-20240724141221-s3v6al1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 516px;\" parent-style=\"width: 526px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 587px;","style":"width: 577px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草果 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草果 1-20240724141100-l0mepwv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 577px;\" parent-style=\"width: 587px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724141104-t0ltjsk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240724141104-t0ltjsk"}},{"ID":"20240902164901-f1o4rvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-f1o4rvr","updated":"20240902164908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：草果"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-dwk3g85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-dwk3g85","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草果《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-2swfpr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-2swfpr2","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】CǎoGuǒ"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ee3l9b8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ee3l9b8","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】FRUCTUSTSAOKO"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-9knhdkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-9knhdkm","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为姜科植物草果Amomumtsao-koCrevostetLemaire的干燥成熟果实。秋季果实成熟时采收，除去杂质，晒干或低温干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-5g934xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-5g934xs","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈长椭圆形，具三钝棱，长2～4cm，直径1～2.5cm。表面灰棕色至红棕色，具纵沟及棱线，顶端有圆形突起的柱基，基部有果梗或果梗痕。果皮质坚韧，易纵向撕裂。剥去外皮，中间有黄棕色隔膜，将种子团分成3瓣，每瓣有种子多为8～11粒。种子呈圆锥状多面体，直径约5mm；表面红棕色，外被灰白色膜质的假种皮，种脊为一条纵沟，尖端有凹状的种脐；质硬，胚乳灰白色。有特异香气，味辛、微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-5lhykrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-5lhykrn","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-xvtphvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-xvtphvd","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品种子横切面：假种皮薄壁细胞含淀粉粒。种皮表皮细胞棕色，长方形，壁较厚；下皮为1列薄壁细胞，含黄色物；油细胞层为1列油细胞，类方形或长方形，切向42～162μm，径向48～68μm，含黄色油滴；色素层为数列棕色细胞，皱缩。内种皮为1列栅状厚壁细胞，棕红色，内壁与侧壁极厚，胞腔小，内含硅质块。外胚乳细胞含淀粉粒及少数细小草酸钙簇晶及方晶。内胚乳细胞含糊粉粒及淀粉粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-9byogfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-9byogfb","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取[含量测定]项下的挥发油，加乙醇制成每1ml含50μl的溶液，作为供试品溶液。另取桉油精对照品，加乙醇制成每1ml含20μl的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各1μl，分别点于同一硅胶Ｇ薄层板上，以正己烷－醋酸乙酯（17:3）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以5％香草醛硫酸溶液，于105℃加热至斑点显色清晰。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同的蓝色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-f34auqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-f34auqi","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-kw0l5c4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-kw0l5c4","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草果仁：取草果，照清炒法（附录ⅡD）炒至焦黄色并微鼓起，去壳，取仁。用时捣碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-thw5mjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-thw5mjp","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"姜草果仁：取净草果仁，照姜汁炙法（附录ⅡD）炒干。用时捣碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-61tpxeq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-61tpxeq","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛、温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-lhs5k40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-lhs5k40","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归脾、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-n6xvl4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-n6xvl4n","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】燥湿温中，除痰截疟。用于寒湿内阻，脘腹胀痛，痞满呕吐，疟疾寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ijbva3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ijbva3v","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～6g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-82ynwnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-82ynwnu","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置阴凉干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-j28ot2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-j28ot2b","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】（1）用于寒湿阻滞脾胃、脘腹胀满；疼痛及呕吐腹泻等症，可与草豆蔻、厚朴、苍朮等同用。用于疟疾，对山岚瘴气、秽浊湿邪所致的瘴疟尤为常用，可与常山、柴胡、知母等配伍。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-4nywvfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-4nywvfz","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-yvce4tf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-yvce4tf","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草果《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ym3y8eu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ym3y8eu","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《品汇精要》"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-s9f7509","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-s9f7509","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】CǎoGuǒ"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-rgw7u2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-rgw7u2t","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】草果仁（《传信适用方》），草果子（《小儿卫生总微论方》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ys33ksj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ys33ksj","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为姜科植物草果的果实。10～11月果实开始成熟，变为红褐色而未开裂时采收，晒干或微火烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-vvnhl12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-vvnhl12","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，丛生，高达2.5米。根茎横走，粗壮有节，直径约2.5厘米。茎圆柱状，直立或稍倾斜。叶2列；具短柄或无柄；叶片长椭圆形或狭长圆形，长约55厘米，宽达20厘米，先端渐尖，基部渐狭，全缘，边缘干膜质，叶两面均光滑无毛；叶鞘开放，包茎，叶舌长0.8～1.2厘米。穗状花序从根茎生出，长约13匣米，直径约5厘米。蒴果密集，长圆形或卵状椭圆形，长2.5～4.5厘米，直径约2厘米，顶端具宿存的花柱，呈短圆状突起，熟时红色，外表面呈不规则的纵皱纹，小果梗长2～5毫米，基部具宿存苞片。花期5～6月。果期9～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-hhkj69e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-hhkj69e","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】栽培或野生于疏林下。分布云南、广西、贵州等地。主产于云南、广西、贵州等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-iupm5cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-iupm5cp","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥果实呈椭圃形，具三钝棱，长2～4厘米，直径1～2.5厘米。顶端有一圆形突起，基部附有节果柄。表面灰棕色至红棕色，有显着纵沟及棱线。果皮有韧性，易纵向撕裂。子房3室，每室含种子8～11枚，集成长球状。种子四至多面形，长宽均为5毫米，表面红棕色，具灰白色膜质假种皮，有纵直的纹理，在较狭的一端有一凹窝状的种脐，合点在背面中央，成一小凹穴，合点与种脐间有一纵沟状的种脊。质坚硬，破开后，内为灰白色。气微弱，种子破碎时发出特异的臭气，味辛辣。以个大、饱满，表面红棕色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-n1dimkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-n1dimkd","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】种子含挥发油等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-hzqgp61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-hzqgp61","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-edjo0z5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-edjo0z5","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草果仁:拣净杂质，置锅内文火炒至外壳焦黄色并微鼓起，取出稍凉，碾去壳，过筛取仁。姜草果仁:取草果仁，加姜汁与水少许，拌匀，微炒，取出，放凉。（每草果仁100斤，用鲜姜10斤取汁）"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-w77cm8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-w77cm8u","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草从新》:\"草果，面裹煨熟，取仁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-lfww9kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-lfww9kq","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-p6z70wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-p6z70wa","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-lx6z86x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-lx6z86x","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《饮膳正要》:\"味辛，性温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-8ptakyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-8ptakyn","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》:\"辛，温，涩，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-jbtvicy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-jbtvicy","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草从新》:\"辛，热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-058szmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-058szmd","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】《雷公炮制药性解》:\"入脾、胃二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ro8prhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ro8prhz","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-aipnatb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-aipnatb","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"燥湿除寒，祛痰截疟，消食化乱治疟疾，痰饮痞满，脘腹冷痛，反胃，呕吐，泻痢，食积。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-a9b59g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-a9b59g7","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①李杲:\"温脾胃，止呕吐，治脾寒湿、寒痰；益真气，消一切冷气膨胀，化疟母，消宿食，解酒毒、果积。兼辟瘴解瘟。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-gj8okia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-gj8okia","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《饮膳正要》:\"治心腹痛，止呕，补胃，下气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-4f4xhvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-4f4xhvm","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》:\"除寒，燥湿，开郁，化食，利膈上痰，解面食、鱼、肉诸毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-r4xr6ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-r4xr6ck","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草求原》:\"治水肿，滞下，功同草蔻。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-y7uwwdi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-y7uwwdi","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服:煎汤，0.8～1.5钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-43t1zub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-43t1zub","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ge9y7zm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ge9y7zm","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气虚或血亏，无寒湿实邪者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-6cn7274","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-6cn7274","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草蒙筌》:\"大耗元阳，老弱虚羸，切宜戒之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-71so49p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-71so49p","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》:\"凡疟不由于瘴气；心痛胃脘痛由于火而不由于寒；湿热瘀滞，暑气外侵而成滞下赤白、里急后重及泄泻暴注、口渴；湿热侵脾因作胀满或小水不利，咸属暑气温热，皆不当用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-9xsd738","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-9xsd738","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草备要》:\"忌铁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-blbhl88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-blbhl88","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-htv3msf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-htv3msf","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治疟疾，胃中寒痰凝结，不易开解:草果、常山、知母、乌梅、槟榔、甘草、穿山甲。水煎服。（《慈幼新书》草果饮）"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-oy8r99v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-oy8r99v","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治瘅疟，脉采弦数，但热不寒，或热多寒少，膈满能食，口苦舌干，心烦，渴水，小便黄赤，大腑不利:青皮（去白）、厚朴（姜制炒）、白术、草果仁、柴胡（去芦）、茯苓（去皮）、半夏（汤泡七次）、黄芩、甘草（炙）各等分。细锉。每服四钱，水一盏半，姜五片，煎至七分，去滓，温服，不拘时侯。（《济生方》清脾汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-wkhm8l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-wkhm8l6","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治肿寒疟疾不愈，振寒少热，面青不食，或大便溏泄，小便反多:草果仁、附子（炮，去皮脐）。上等分，细锉。每服半两，水二盏，生姜七片，枣一枚，煎至七分，去滓温服，不拘时候。（《济生方》果附汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-c7t7nkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-c7t7nkk","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治脾痛胀满:草果仁二个。酒煎服之。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-mmuxejb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-mmuxejb","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治肠胃冷热不和，下痢赤白，及伏热泄泻，脏毒便血:草果子、甘草、地榆、枳壳（去穰，麸炒）。上等分为粗末。每服二钱，用水一盏半，煨姜一块，拍碎，同煎七分，去滓服，不拘时候。（《传信适用方》草果饮）"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-d9rz3qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-d9rz3qs","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治瘟疫初起，先憎寒而后发热，日后但热而无憎寒，初起二、三日，其脉不浮不沉而数，昼夜发热，日哺益甚，头身疼痛:槟榔二钱，厚朴一钱，草果仁五分，知母一钱，芍药一钱，黄芩一钱，甘草五分。用水一钟，煎八分，午后温服。（《瘟疫论》达原饮）"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-lwxjk5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-lwxjk5e","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-zckdbnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-zckdbnx","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》:\"草果，与知母同用，治瘴疟寒热，取其一阴一阳无偏胜之害，盖草果治太阴独胜之寒，知母治阳明独胜之火也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ssmfc1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ssmfc1h","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求真》:\"草果与草豆蔻，诸书皆载气味相同，功效无别，服之皆能温胃逐寒。然此气味浮散，凡冒巅雾不正瘴疟，服之直入病所而皆有效。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-xnyk57y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-xnyk57y","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草正义》:\"草果，辛温燥烈，善除寒湿而温燥中宫，故为脾胃寒湿主药。\"\"按岚瘴皆雾露阴湿之邪，最伤清阳之气，故辟瘴多用温燥芳香，以胜阴霍湿浊之蕴祟。草果之治瘴疟，意亦犹是。然凡是疟疾，多湿痰蒙蔽为患，故寒热往来，纠缠不巳，治宜开泄为先。草果善涤湿痰，而振脾阳，更以知母辅之，酌量其分量，随时损益，治疟颇有妙义，固不必专为岚瘴立法。惟石顽所谓实邪不盛者，当在所禁耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-m9rronb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-m9rronb","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-0c5lf8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-0c5lf8m","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草果《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-w7g61qu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-w7g61qu","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《品汇精要》：草果，生广南及海南。形如橄榄，其皮薄，其色紫，其仁如缩砂仁而大。又云南出者，名云南草果，其形差小耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-r5hyy5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-r5hyy5x","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】CǎoGuǒ"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-eee4x6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-eee4x6h","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】TsaokoAmomumFruit,Caoguo"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-xtufgs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-xtufgs5","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】草果仁、草果子、老蔻"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-gv65fnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-gv65fnl","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-h55kegh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-h55kegh","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为姜科植物草果的果实。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-okzw4nh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-okzw4nh","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Amomumtsao-koCrevostetLemarie[A.hongtsaokoC.F.LiangetD.Fang;A.guixienseD.Fang]"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-x505fo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-x505fo0","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：果熟期广西是8-9月，云南是11-12月。当果实红褐色时采收，晒干或烘干，或用沸水烫2-3min后，再晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-wdn5m2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-wdn5m2c","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】草果，多年生草本，高2-2.5m。全株有辛辣气味。茎基部膨大，直径达6cm。叶2列，11-14枚，无叶柄，或上部叶有短柄；叶舌带紫色，长1-2cm，膜质，被疏柔毛；叶鞘具条纹，叶舌及叶鞘边缘近革质；叶片长圆状披针形至卵形，长20-83cm，宽5-19cm，先端长渐尖，基部楔形，全缘，两面无毛。花葶从茎基部抽出，长渐尖，基部楔形，全缘，两面无毛。花葶从茎基部抽出，长13-28cm；总花梗长4-13cm；鳞片阔卵形，长1-8cm；穗状花序长9-15cm；苞片淡红色，长圆形，长3.3-4cm，宽7-9mm，外面疏被短柔毛；小苞片管状，长1.7-2cm，2浅裂；外被疏短柔毛；花浅橙色，长5.5-7cm；小花梗长不超过5mm；花萼长2.3-3cm，3齿裂，一侧浅裂，近无毛或疏被短柔毛；花冠管长2.5-2.8cm，被短柔毛，裂片长圆形，长约2.3cm，宽约6mm，后方一枚兜状，长约2.5cm，宽约1.5cm；唇瓣长圆状倒卵形，长3-3.5cm，宽约1.6cm，边缘多皱，中脉两侧各有一条红色条纹；雄蕊长2-2.5cm，花丝长约1cm，花药长1.3-1.5cm，药隔附属体长约5mm，具啮蚀状牙齿；花柱被疏短毛，柱头漏斗状；子房无毛。蒴果成熟时暗紫色，近球形，长2.5-4.5cm，直径2-2.5cm，干时变橄榄形，黑褐色，先端具残存的花被管，基部有短柄。种子多数。花期4-5月，果期8-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-oq0u2x5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-oq0u2x5","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-yhiuale","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-yhiuale","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于沟边林下。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ux1jkv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ux1jkv6","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于广西和云南南部地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-qraboxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-qraboxz","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-6hgzcbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-6hgzcbj","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜温暖湿润气候，怕热，怕旱，怕霜冻。以在海拔1000-2000m，年平均温度18-20℃，荫蔽度50%-60%左右的林下或溪分湿润的山谷坡地，疏松肥沃。富含腐殖质的砂质壤土栽培为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-cbs770q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-cbs770q","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用种子繁殖和分株繁殖。种子繁殖：8-9月果实成熟果皮呈紫红色时采收，剥去果皮，洗净果肉，再用清水浸种10h左右，然后拌湿沙贮藏。8-11月播种，也可在到年2-3月播种。条播，行距15cm，播深1.5-2cm，覆土盖草林水。播后约1个月出土，需搭荫棚遮荫，追施草木灰和腐熟的猪牛粪。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-s5oocq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-s5oocq4","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经培育1-2年，苗高60-120cm，叶出圃定植。在4月上旬，按行株距1.7m×2m，穴宽30cm，深15cm开穴，每穴栽苗1-2株，选阴雨天进行定植。分株繁殖；选健壮母株带芽的根茎分株，每丛有苗2-3株，种后填细上踏实，盖草，淋水。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-wesg9n2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-wesg9n2","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理定植后每年干着、秋季中耕除草2-3次。在秋季除草时，剪去枯株、病株和已结过果的老株，中耕除草结合追肥，采用环状沟施绿肥、堆肥和磷肥等。在开花前进行培土，促使幼芽生长健壮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-97jv9xm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-97jv9xm","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治病害有立信病，为害幼苗，严重时成片死亡，可将病株拔除，周围撤石灰粉，或用50%多菌灵1000倍液浇灌。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-y4gxhmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-y4gxhmz","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-44g21jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-44g21jy","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别，果实椭圆形，长2-4.5cm，直径1-2.5cm，表面棕色或红棕色，具3钝棱及明显的纵沟及棱线，先端有圆形突起的柱基，基部有果柄或果柄痕，果皮坚韧，内分3室，每室含种子7-24粒，种子集结成团。种子多面形，直径5-7mm，黄棕色或红棕色，具灰白色膜质假种皮，中央有凹陷合点，较狭端腹面有圆窝状种脐，种脊凹陷成1纵沟。气芳香，味辛、辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-0dwdb5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-0dwdb5z","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以个大、饱满、色红棕、’气味浓行为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-bl5v0mn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-bl5v0mn","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别种子横切面：类肾形，外周微波状。假种皮细胞多列，壁稍弯曲；种皮表皮细胞1列，径向延长，排列较整齐，壁厚稍弯曲，外被角质层；下皮细胞1列，不含色素；油细胞1列，较大，切向延长约至139μm；色素层细胞5-9列，内含棕黄色或淡黄色物；内种皮厚壁细胞褐红色、棕红色或黄红色，径向延长约至132μpm，内壁厚约至85μm，端胸腔内硅质块直径20-38μm。外胚乳细胞充满由微小淀粉粒集结而成的淀粉团，有的尚含细小草酸钙方晶或簇晶；内胚乳含糊粉粒。胚细胞含糊粉粒，并含脂肪油滴。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-kz5uxv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-kz5uxv0","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：黄白色或棕白色。①种皮表皮细胞表面观长条形，末端渐尖或钝圆，长至263μ，直径20-45μm，外具角质层。②下皮细胞长方形或长条形，长74-149μm，直径28-46μm，常与种皮表皮细胞上下层垂直排列③油细胞含油液。④内种皮厚壁细胞表面观多角形或类图形，人小（24－42）μm×V（32-60）μm，壁厚约7μm，非木化，胸腔内含硅质块，大小（15-23）μm×（19-35）μm；切面观细胞排成栅状，胞腔位于一端，内含硅质块。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-olktbmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-olktbmf","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-w7bwzuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-w7bwzuw","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"果实含挥发油，油中的主要成分为α-蒎烯(α-pinene)，β-蒎烯(β-pinenen)，1，8-桉叶素(1,8-cineole)，ρ-聚伞花烃(ρ-cymene)，芳樟醇(linaloolo)，α-松油醇(α-terpineol），橙花叔醇(nerolidol)，壬醛(nonanal)，癸醛(capricaldehyde)，反-2-十一烯醛(trans-2-undecenal，为本品中的辛辣成分)，橙花醛(neral)，牻牛儿醇(geraniol)；另含微量元素(ug/g)：锌69.2，铜7.33，铁57.2，锰283.7，钻0.89。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-o8pf47v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-o8pf47v","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"种子油挥发油21种成分：主要为1，8-桉叶素(1,8-cineole)，2-癸烯醛(2-decenal)，牻牛儿醛(geranial)，橙花醛(neral)。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-1fyfx06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-1fyfx06","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-keakfwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-keakfwz","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.镇咳祛痰作用：本品所含的a-和β-蒎烯有镇咳祛痰作用。1，8-桉油素有镇痛、解热、平喘等作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ipn97o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ipn97o6","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗炎、抗菌作用：B-蒎烯有较强的抗炎作用，并有抗真菌作用。香叶醇有抗细菌和真菌作用，对发须癣菌和奥杜安氏小孢子菌的最低抑菌浓度为0.39mg/ml。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-9rkckxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-9rkckxc","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.其它作用：小剂量香叶醇能抑制大鼠的自发活动。大鼠口服香叶醇能抑制胃肠运动，小量口服有轻度利尿作用。香叶醇还有驱豚鼠蛔虫作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-s1numvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-s1numvb","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】大鼠口服香叶醇的半数致死量为4.8g/kg，兔静脉注射为50mg/kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-aqlur6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-aqlur6d","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-wpe17qu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-wpe17qu","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理化鉴别，薄层角谱：取本品挥发油，加乙醇制成每1ml含50μl的溶液，作为供试品溶液。加取桉油精对照品，加乙醇制成每1ml含20μl的溶液，作为对照品溶液。吸取上述两种溶液各1μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以正已烷-醋酸乙酯(17:3)为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以5%香草醛硫酸溶液，于105℃烘数分钟，供试品色谱中在与对照品角谱相应的位置上，显相同的蓝色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ar4plbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ar4plbo","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版规定：本品种子团含挥发油不得少于1.4%（ml/g）"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-at49kdk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-at49kdk","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】草果仁：拣净杂质，置锅内文火炒至外壳焦黄色并微鼓起，取出稍凉，碾去壳，过筛取仁。姜草果仁：取草果仁，加姜汁与水少许，拌匀，微炒，取出，放凉。（每草果仁100斤，用鲜姜10斤取汁）《本草从新》：草果，面裹煨熟，取仁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-j4yynlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-j4yynlo","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-jyaukj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-jyaukj5","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】脾；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-m4fblfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-m4fblfz","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】燥湿温中祛痰截疟。主脘腹冷痛；恶心呕吐；胞膈痞满；泄泻泻；下痢；疟疾"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-z7vf5mj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-z7vf5mj","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-6g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-k8s0uz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-k8s0uz4","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】阴虚血少者禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-s6x7k35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-s6x7k35","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-i70hyfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-i70hyfa","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《纲目》：草果，与知母同用，治瘴疟寒热，取其一阴一阳无偏胜之害，盖草果治太阴独胜之寒，知母治阳明独胜之火也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-w8uoimz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-w8uoimz","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草求真》：草果与草豆蔻，诸书皆载气味相同，功效无别，服之皆能温胃逐寒。然此气味浮散，凡冒巅雾不正瘴疟，服之直入病所而皆有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-kh8blc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-kh8blc6","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草正义》：草果，辛温燥烈，善除寒湿而温燥中宫，故为脾胃寒湿主药。按岚瘴皆雾露阴湿之邪，最伤清阳之气，故辟瘴多用温燥芳香，以胜阴霾湿浊之蕴祟。草果之治瘴疟，意亦犹是。然凡是疟疾，多湿痰蒙蔽为患，故寒热往来，纠缠不已，治宜开泄为先。草果善涤湿痰，而振脾阳，更以知母辅之，酌量其分量，随时损益，治疟颇有妙义，固不必专为岚瘴立法。惟石顽所谓实邪不盛者，当在所禁耳。李杲：温脾胃，止呕吐，治脾寒湿、寒痰；益真气，消一切冷气膨胀，化疟母，消宿食，解酒毒、果积。兼辟瘴解瘟。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-zafkkk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-zafkkk9","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《饮膳正要》：治心腹痛，止呕，补胃，下气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-i9ehp6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-i9ehp6h","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本经逢原》：除寒，燥湿，开郁，化食，利膈上痰，解面食、鱼、肉诸毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-jjcbv66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-jjcbv66","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草求原》：治水肿，滞下，功同草寇。"}]},{"ID":"20240902164901-ya7x6qv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164901-ya7x6qv","updated":"20240902164914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902164903-nqgnb2g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902164903-nqgnb2g","updated":"20240902164914"}},{"ID":"20240902164904-t8opkpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902164904-t8opkpg","updated":"20240902164914"}}]}